  $vtg$sweetauburn$vtg$, $vtg$atlanta$vtg$, $vtg$Sweet Auburn$vtg$, $vtg$Street$vtg$, array[$vtg$Street$vtg$, $vtg$Portraits$vtg$]::text[], $vtg$golden$vtg$, $vtg$Historic district, alive at dusk$vtg$, $vtg$Historic district · street & portraits$vtg$, $vtg$The heart of Atlanta's historic Black business district hums on a warm evening — market stalls, front-porch talk, and low sun raking down Auburn Avenue. It's a street room where everyone's a little more open.$vtg$, array[$vtg$Murals along Auburn Ave — backlit and glowing right at dusk.$vtg$, $vtg$The Municipal Market crowd — candid portraits as people spill out.$vtg$, $vtg$The old marquee signs catch the last warm light near 8:20.$vtg$]::text[], $vtg$6 min drive · evening street parking on Edgewood · MARTA King Memorial, a short walk.$vtg$, null, 33.755, -84.372, true)
